The '''Sanbra sector''' was a [[sector]] in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> It contained the [[Baarstal system]]<ref name="Appendix">{{GalaxyMapAppendix}}</ref> and the [[Ileenium system]], where the [[planet]] [[D'Qar]], home to a [[Resistance]] [[Resistance base|base]], was located.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> It bordered the [[Bon'nyuw-Luq sector]].<ref name="TFA Worlds">{{SW|url=news/where-in-the-galaxy-are-the-worlds-of-star-wars-the-force-awakens|text=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of ''Star Wars: The Force Awakens''?|int=Where in the Galaxy Are the Worlds of Star Wars: The Force Awakens?}}</ref>

